Package: SAMatch
Type: Package
Title: Shared Anchor Matching: A Scalable Matching Framework for
        Multiple Treatment Groups
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sungjun Hong", email = "hsj2864@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Implements a scalable framework for simultaneously matching
    multiple treatment groups to a shared anchor group. The method combines
    generalized propensity score estimation, GPS-guided candidate screening,
    and Mahalanobis-distance-based matching. Also provides covariate-balance
    diagnostics, matched-cohort outcome analysis, three-way propensity score
    matching, and multi-arm weighting methods.
